<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Creating DPS, IoT Hub and ADR Instances</strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Welcome back to this series of posts exploring the latest features of Azure IoT Hub, Device Provisioning Service (DPS), and Azure Device Registration (ADR). </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>In the previous post we dove deeper into DPS and what's new. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"textColor":"#f6f6f4"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-f-6-f-6-f-4-color has-text-color">Contents:</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

