<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="time-to-build">Time to Build!</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Now that you know what DPS does, let's stand up the Azure resources. We'll create a resource group, IoT Hub, and DPS, then link them. We'll also prep ADR so certificate policies are ready for issuance.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="two-ways-to-use-this-series">Two Ways to Use This Series</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->
<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="option-1-quick-start-clone-and-run">Option 1: Quick Start (Clone and Run)</h4>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

